  "details": "Lately I've noticed an increasing amount of VR users whose IK at times would become severely reduced making them appear to move in slow motion when within close range of them. Now I'm not sure if this is an issue with said user's network or an actual issue with the network in general so I'm submitting a canny just in case. I've provided a google drive folder with the output logs and an example video. Output log is fairly large. (10 hour session)\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1kypkHZu6jUhlFwlhp1ELQqYEd0jSOMWd?usp=sharing",
